1
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:11,991
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">FROM ME TO YOU</font>

2
00:01:01,082 --> 00:01:06,003
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">DETERMINATION</font>

3
00:01:06,587 --> 00:01:08,464
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What am I... supposed to do?</font>

4
00:01:08,547 --> 00:01:10,382
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako... Sawako!</font>

5
00:01:10,466 --> 00:01:12,093
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hello? Earth to Sawako!</font>

6
00:01:14,053 --> 00:01:17,056
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Something wrong, sweetheart?
You're spilling rice all over the place.</font>

7
00:01:17,139 --> 00:01:20,392
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You feeling all right?</font>

8
00:01:20,476 --> 00:01:24,021
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Y-Yeah, I'm okay. I'm just
worried about exams, I guess.</font>

9
00:01:24,105 --> 00:01:27,108
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ah, of course. Those start tomorrow, huh?</font>

10
00:01:27,191 --> 00:01:29,443
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Mhm. Thanks for the meal, mom.</font>

11
00:01:30,027 --> 00:01:31,779
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh~ you're done already?</font>

12
00:01:31,862 --> 00:01:32,780
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah.</font>

13
00:01:33,531 --> 00:01:38,202
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">When I actually see Yano,
Yoshida, or even Kazehaya tomorrow...</font>

14
00:01:39,787 --> 00:01:42,039
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I wonder... what I should do.</font>

15
00:01:48,254 --> 00:01:54,176
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, right. We're having exams today,
so our seats are in alphabetical order.</font>

16
00:01:54,260 --> 00:01:57,012
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So who ended up in my usual seat?</font>

17
00:01:57,888 --> 00:01:59,098
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's Yano...</font>

18
00:01:59,723 --> 00:02:03,144
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She's sitting in my seat like nothing.
Even though it's my fault she's being</font>

19
00:02:03,227 --> 00:02:06,647
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">gossiped about.</font>

20
00:02:06,730 --> 00:02:11,735
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Come to think of it... Ever since I've
known them, Yano, Yoshida, and Kazehaya</font>

21
00:02:11,819 --> 00:02:16,866
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">have never tried to avoid me...
Nor have they been afraid of me.</font>

22
00:02:18,159 --> 00:02:20,536
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">They've always been... so kind.</font>

23
00:02:26,458 --> 00:02:27,376
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Morning.</font>

24
00:02:28,794 --> 00:02:31,088
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sadako's seat? Wow,
what are the odds of that?</font>

25
00:02:31,172 --> 00:02:34,091
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- I know, right?
- What about her?</font>

26
00:02:36,010 --> 00:02:39,388
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Well, she typically takes the time to
greet everyone in class even though</font>

27
00:02:39,471 --> 00:02:42,850
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">they're freaked out by her, but today was
different. -She went straight to her seat</font>

28
00:02:42,933 --> 00:02:46,437
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">without even making eye
contact. -Why's that?</font>

29
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:49,481
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- There's a test today?
- I'm not sure...</font>

30
00:02:49,565 --> 00:02:52,568
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But it means that's
not the Sadako we know.</font>

31
00:02:54,028 --> 00:02:57,573
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">To be honest... After moving away from my
assigned seat... it's almost like... it was</font>

32
00:02:57,656 --> 00:03:01,202
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">never there.</font>

33
00:03:03,245 --> 00:03:05,206
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">As if it never existed.</font>

34
00:03:06,207 --> 00:03:10,127
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It feels like it was just
a dream. A distant one.</font>

35
00:03:12,755 --> 00:03:16,675
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I didn't mean to cause trouble for any
of them. All I wanted to do was help.</font>

36
00:03:16,759 --> 00:03:20,679
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Although... I still haven't been able to
clear up that misunderstanding with Yano</font>

37
00:03:20,763 --> 00:03:24,683
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}and Yoshida.</font>

38
00:03:24,767 --> 00:03:28,437
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But what does it matter? Even if I find
whoever's spreading those rumors and</font>

39
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:32,233
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">resolve everything... as long as I'm
around, I'm sure I'll only end up hurting</font>

40
00:03:32,316 --> 00:03:36,320
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">them again.</font>

41
00:03:36,403 --> 00:03:38,697
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And they don't deserve that.</font>

42
00:03:39,490 --> 00:03:44,328
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Things may straighten out eventually... But
Yano and Yoshida are hurting right now and</font>

43
00:03:44,411 --> 00:03:49,250
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I have no idea how I'm supposed to
comfort either of them until then.</font>

44
00:03:49,333 --> 00:03:55,339
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's why... I think it's better to go
back to the way I was and distance myself.</font>

45
00:03:55,422 --> 00:03:58,300
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}It's for the best. I'm sure of it.</font>

46
00:03:59,760 --> 00:04:03,472
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I wonder if Yoshida ended up using the
notes I gave her. Hopefully they helped,</font>

47
00:04:03,555 --> 00:04:07,434
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">even if just a little bit.</font>

48
00:04:07,518 --> 00:04:13,107
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Guess what, Yano? I finally learned how to
tell a ghost story properly. I wanted you</font>

49
00:04:13,190 --> 00:04:18,821
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">to be the first one I told it to,
but... that probably won't happen.</font>

50
00:04:22,533 --> 00:04:24,076
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And Kazehaya... I...</font>

51
00:04:33,168 --> 00:04:35,462
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I... always felt so happy.</font>

52
00:04:37,548 --> 00:04:43,012
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It was a feeling I've yearned for.
Something I've dreamed of... ...for so long...</font>

53
00:04:44,471 --> 00:04:48,809
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I... don't know how I was able
to stand being alone before.</font>

54
00:04:49,727 --> 00:04:53,063
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Now that I've gotten to experience how it
feels to be treated with kindness... How it</font>

55
00:04:53,147 --> 00:04:56,442
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">feels to reciprocate it...</font>

56
00:04:56,525 --> 00:05:00,738
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It seems impossible to go
back to the way things were.</font>

57
00:05:00,821 --> 00:05:05,534
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What was the point in being
alone? And why did I tolerate it?</font>

58
00:05:06,869 --> 00:05:10,789
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I don't... remember...
Nothing's coming back to me.</font>

59
00:05:13,709 --> 00:05:14,626
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Nothing.</font>

60
00:05:36,065 --> 00:05:40,903
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Just like that first day of summer
break, Kazehaya was sitting here, waiting</font>

61
00:05:40,986 --> 00:05:46,075
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- for me, in the same exact place.
- It doesn't make any sense.</font>

62
00:05:46,158 --> 00:05:48,952
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If you don't hate me, then why avoid me?</font>

63
00:05:53,832 --> 00:05:56,502
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">"Don't... talk to me. Ever again."</font>

64
00:05:59,546 --> 00:06:03,509
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wait! I'm sorry, I take it back!</font>

65
00:06:03,592 --> 00:06:06,637
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's too hard to say something
like that when I don't really mean it!</font>

66
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:09,765
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh... what? -But I don't
wanna ruin your reputation!</font>

67
00:06:09,848 --> 00:06:12,976
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wha- Huh?!</font>

68
00:06:13,060 --> 00:06:14,478
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kuronuma!</font>

69
00:06:14,561 --> 00:06:18,273
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Speak clearly so I can
understand what you're saying!</font>

70
00:06:20,442 --> 00:06:22,945
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">They say that I'll ruin your
reputation if you keep hanging out with</font>

71
00:06:23,028 --> 00:06:25,531
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- me!
- What? Who's saying that?</font>

72
00:06:25,614 --> 00:06:28,075
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- T-The rumors...
- Rumors?</font>

73
00:06:29,159 --> 00:06:34,498
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Well, if they're about me, then how
come I don't get a say in any of this?</font>

74
00:06:35,332 --> 00:06:39,002
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You don't get to make
decisions for me, Kuronuma!</font>

75
00:06:39,086 --> 00:06:43,090
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I can make them myself!</font>

76
00:06:43,882 --> 00:06:46,552
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I do... whatever I want to do.</font>

77
00:06:48,053 --> 00:06:50,389
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If I wanna talk to you, I will.</font>

78
00:06:50,472 --> 00:06:54,601
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And if I didn't want to, then
I wouldn't be here right now.</font>

79
00:06:57,604 --> 00:07:00,232
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I don't care about rumors.</font>

80
00:07:00,315 --> 00:07:05,154
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Why bother believing them? The
only one I choose to trust is you.</font>

81
00:07:07,823 --> 00:07:10,742
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's... what I've always yearned for.</font>

82
00:07:11,869 --> 00:07:16,540
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">To have a person like Yano,
Yoshida, or Kazehaya in my life.</font>

83
00:07:17,791 --> 00:07:21,086
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's something I've
dreamed of for so long...</font>

84
00:07:21,712 --> 00:07:24,965
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Knowing what it's like
to care for someone.</font>

85
00:07:25,048 --> 00:07:27,926
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And knowing how it feels to be cared for.</font>

86
00:07:33,432 --> 00:07:34,475
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}Feeling better?</font>

87
00:07:36,602 --> 00:07:41,148
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thanks, Kazehaya! I was super thirsty!</font>

88
00:07:43,358 --> 00:07:46,487
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">This should be enough.</font>

89
00:07:46,570 --> 00:07:47,488
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hm?</font>

90
00:07:49,781 --> 00:07:53,076
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">This definitely covers it.</font>

91
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:57,581
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Just a moment ago, I felt
so sad and discouraged.</font>

92
00:07:58,248 --> 00:07:59,958
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">How strange.</font>

93
00:08:00,042 --> 00:08:04,588
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">When Kazehaya smiles, my
clouded mind clears up instantly.</font>

94
00:08:05,464 --> 00:08:08,425
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's like... he's unravelling my heart.</font>

95
00:08:09,426 --> 00:08:14,306
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Why bother believing them? The
only one I choose to trust is you.</font>

96
00:08:14,389 --> 00:08:16,225
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">When he said that...</font>

97
00:08:16,308 --> 00:08:21,146
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It felt like him saying I could
stay by his side. It made me happy.</font>

98
00:08:22,689 --> 00:08:25,317
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I see. So the rumors made it
awkward between you, Yano, and Yoshida.</font>

99
00:08:25,400 --> 00:08:28,028
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Mhm.</font>

100
00:08:29,738 --> 00:08:34,368
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- What if things were the other way around?
- Huh? Like if the rumor was that by</font>

101
00:08:34,451 --> 00:08:39,039
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">hanging out with you... Yano, Yoshida, and I
would ruin your reputation.</font>

102
00:08:39,122 --> 00:08:41,542
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So we distanced ourselves from you.</font>

103
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:43,961
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'd hate that!</font>

104
00:08:45,754 --> 00:08:47,422
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'd wanna stay together!</font>

105
00:08:50,259 --> 00:08:53,470
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Bet Yano and Yoshida
would say the same thing.</font>

106
00:08:54,888 --> 00:08:58,267
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It just depends on how
the other person feels.</font>

107
00:08:58,350 --> 00:09:01,770
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">We don't know what those two are
actually thinking... But if it's obvious</font>

108
00:09:01,853 --> 00:09:05,274
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">you're avoiding them,
they might get worried.</font>

109
00:09:05,357 --> 00:09:08,735
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And if they're like me, I definitely did.</font>

110
00:09:08,819 --> 00:09:10,737
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I am so so so so so sorry!</font>

111
00:09:10,821 --> 00:09:12,948
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- So, enough!
- Huh?</font>

112
00:09:13,031 --> 00:09:14,032
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No more, okay?</font>

113
00:09:14,575 --> 00:09:16,618
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ya got that? No distancing.</font>

114
00:09:18,829 --> 00:09:20,706
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">This is... different.</font>

115
00:09:20,789 --> 00:09:23,458
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Instead of not letting me near them,
there's someone who won't let me avoid</font>

116
00:09:23,542 --> 00:09:26,253
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">them?</font>

117
00:09:28,171 --> 00:09:32,301
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I... I guess I've been keeping my thoughts
to myself lately, haven't I? But I should</font>

118
00:09:32,384 --> 00:09:36,722
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">ask them... No...</font>

119
00:09:36,805 --> 00:09:39,766
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">They won't know if I don't just tell them.</font>

120
00:09:40,517 --> 00:09:44,479
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's important that I make everything
clear to Yano and Yoshida. I want them to</font>

121
00:09:44,563 --> 00:09:48,525
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">understand... exactly how I feel.</font>

122
00:09:50,319 --> 00:09:53,280
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">At least you know you can open up to them.</font>

123
00:09:56,158 --> 00:09:59,870
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm... going to try
talking with Yano and Yoshida.</font>

124
00:09:59,953 --> 00:10:04,499
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And I would like it very much if maybe
instead of just classmates... I hope we can</font>

125
00:10:04,583 --> 00:10:09,129
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">become f-friends... N-No! I will try my
absolute hardest and I will become their</font>

126
00:10:09,212 --> 00:10:13,759
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">friend!</font>

127
00:10:15,469 --> 00:10:16,511
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I said it.</font>

128
00:10:17,054 --> 00:10:18,764
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Well...
- Huh?</font>

129
00:10:21,808 --> 00:10:23,060
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Just do your best!</font>

130
00:10:28,482 --> 00:10:29,566
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Right!</font>

131
00:10:30,734 --> 00:10:36,281
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">His kind words... and that smile...
they always push me to keep going.</font>

132
00:10:43,413 --> 00:10:47,834
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hang in there, Kuronuma.
You've got this. I know you do.</font>

133
00:10:49,086 --> 00:10:50,128
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Good luck.</font>

134
00:10:51,588 --> 00:10:54,966
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kazehaya... Thank you. I'll make you proud.</font>

135
00:10:57,010 --> 00:10:59,513
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I will do my best, I promise!</font>

136
00:11:08,438 --> 00:11:12,442
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Why are you still here? Go home
already, you've got exams to study for.</font>

137
00:11:12,526 --> 00:11:15,320
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's why I was just
heading to the library, actually.</font>

138
00:11:15,404 --> 00:11:18,198
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Really... You may not look it,
but you're pretty studious.</font>

139
00:11:18,281 --> 00:11:21,034
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">First of all, this
entire thing is your fault!</font>

140
00:11:21,118 --> 00:11:23,787
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh?</font>

141
00:11:23,870 --> 00:11:26,873
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If you hadn't popped
up at that exact moment-</font>

142
00:11:26,957 --> 00:11:30,001
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What's with the irrational accusation
all of a sudden? If I hadn't "popped up"</font>

143
00:11:30,085 --> 00:11:32,671
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">when?</font>

144
00:11:32,754 --> 00:11:35,382
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thanks to you, we weren't able
to overhear Sadako's conversation.</font>

145
00:11:35,465 --> 00:11:38,051
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What?</font>

146
00:11:38,802 --> 00:11:40,262
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Just forget about it.</font>

147
00:11:41,221 --> 00:11:43,807
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}Hey. Don't play the blame game.</font>

148
00:11:43,890 --> 00:11:47,102
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I don't really know what's going on in
your life, but I can tell you that nothing</font>

149
00:11:47,185 --> 00:11:50,397
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">will get resolved by blaming other folks.
Listen up, you're gonna be faced with a</font>

150
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:53,650
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">lot of unfair stuff in the future...</font>

151
00:11:53,734 --> 00:11:57,446
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It can be difficult sometimes, but you've
gotta learn how to figure things out on</font>

152
00:11:57,529 --> 00:12:01,241
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">your own. And that means even if I'm the
one who's causing the problems for ya!</font>

153
00:12:01,324 --> 00:12:04,953
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Deal with it yourself, Yano!</font>

154
00:12:05,036 --> 00:12:07,789
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, and come to think of it, that paper
better have made its way over to Ryu's</font>

155
00:12:07,873 --> 00:12:10,625
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- hands.
- That crap? I burned it to a crisp.</font>

156
00:12:10,709 --> 00:12:13,503
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You did what?!</font>

157
00:12:15,297 --> 00:12:17,132
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Don't play the blame game.</font>

158
00:12:18,091 --> 00:12:20,051
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Give me a break.</font>

159
00:12:21,803 --> 00:12:23,972
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I don't need that from him...</font>

160
00:12:30,061 --> 00:12:33,064
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}Isn't this the one Sadako was reading?</font>

161
00:12:33,982 --> 00:12:35,192
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I was right.</font>

162
00:12:35,984 --> 00:12:37,152
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">YOTSUYA KAIDAN</font>

163
00:12:37,235 --> 00:12:38,403
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">TRUE GHOST STORIES</font>

164
00:12:38,487 --> 00:12:39,571
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">SAWAKO KURONUMA</font>

165
00:12:41,823 --> 00:12:48,038
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">This one too. But why is she
checking out Japanese horror stories?</font>

166
00:12:48,121 --> 00:12:49,289
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She's an odd one.</font>

167
00:12:49,956 --> 00:12:54,336
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">At this point, why don't you think about
just using that image to your advantage?</font>

168
00:12:54,419 --> 00:12:58,840
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It was a joke. Did she take it seriously?</font>

169
00:13:00,759 --> 00:13:02,385
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She's so earnest.</font>

170
00:13:08,058 --> 00:13:09,392
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, you're sulking.</font>

171
00:13:13,146 --> 00:13:15,232
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Do you need me to comfort you?</font>

172
00:13:16,233 --> 00:13:19,319
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I am not sulking! What gave you that idea?</font>

173
00:13:19,986 --> 00:13:23,281
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ever since you were young, you'd sit out
here with the same look on your face after</font>

174
00:13:23,365 --> 00:13:26,660
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">getting kicked out of the
house for causing trouble...</font>

175
00:13:26,743 --> 00:13:30,038
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Shut your mouth. So, what? You get back
from a jog? -Yeah, it's a secret training</font>

176
00:13:30,121 --> 00:13:33,333
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- plan that Pin put together.
- Pin!</font>

177
00:13:33,416 --> 00:13:35,794
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If that guy hadn't just
appeared out of nowhere...</font>

178
00:13:35,877 --> 00:13:38,296
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm gonna guess the reason you're upset
isn't because people are saying you're a</font>

179
00:13:38,380 --> 00:13:40,841
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">delinquent. I don't give a crap
about some stupid rumor! Nah, I figured.</font>

180
00:13:43,510 --> 00:13:47,097
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'll be the first to admit I'm not that
smart. -So how am I s'posed to understand</font>

181
00:13:47,180 --> 00:13:50,767
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">all this?! Is Sadako really who she says
she is or does she have a dark-side</font>

182
00:13:50,851 --> 00:13:54,104
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">lurking within her?! -Can't
exactly say that I get it either.</font>

183
00:13:54,187 --> 00:13:57,440
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Basically what happened was, someone...
told me the rumors came straight from</font>

184
00:13:57,524 --> 00:14:01,069
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Sadako.
- Okay and how'd she manage to</font>

185
00:14:01,152 --> 00:14:03,572
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">spread them around? Talking to herself?</font>

186
00:14:03,655 --> 00:14:06,116
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If that was the case, people would be
gossiping about how she's a weirdo who</font>

187
00:14:06,199 --> 00:14:09,369
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">mumbles to herself all the time!</font>

188
00:14:09,452 --> 00:14:12,789
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Well, it doesn't seem like
she has anyone to talk to.</font>

189
00:14:12,873 --> 00:14:16,918
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, my gosh! I didn't really think
about it before, but that's so true!</font>

190
00:14:17,002 --> 00:14:17,919
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You idiot.</font>

191
00:14:19,921 --> 00:14:23,216
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I just remembered she was talking to some
girl we didn't know. And one of the things</font>

192
00:14:23,300 --> 00:14:26,595
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sadako mentioned was that
we weren't her friends.</font>

193
00:14:26,678 --> 00:14:29,681
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">To be honest, she doesn't really seem to
like me and Yoshida at all. Because she's</font>

194
00:14:29,764 --> 00:14:32,851
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">kinda been avoiding us.</font>

195
00:14:33,977 --> 00:14:38,565
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Jeez! What the hell did she mean by "I'm
sorry"?! I gave you the chance! Why didn't</font>

196
00:14:38,648 --> 00:14:41,902
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">you just say you liked us?!</font>

197
00:14:41,985 --> 00:14:45,238
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Could be that she doesn't
feel that way about you two.</font>

198
00:14:46,281 --> 00:14:49,159
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">All right, wise guy... You sayin' she
hates us? Or that we were both bein' used</font>

199
00:14:49,242 --> 00:14:52,120
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- by her?
- Who knows? Another</font>

200
00:14:52,203 --> 00:14:55,415
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">alternative is that she doesn't care.</font>

201
00:14:55,498 --> 00:14:59,836
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But... There's also plenty of
other possibilities it could be.</font>

202
00:14:59,920 --> 00:15:03,340
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What the... How do I
know which it is, then?</font>

203
00:15:03,423 --> 00:15:06,843
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Beats the hell outta me. If
you're curious, why not ask her?</font>

204
00:15:06,927 --> 00:15:10,221
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If she tells you she doesn't care, I've
got a shoulder you can come cry on. See</font>

205
00:15:10,305 --> 00:15:13,683
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- ya.
- No thank you!</font>

206
00:15:16,019 --> 00:15:21,942
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">TO YOSHIDA-SAN
KEY POINTS</font>

207
00:15:25,028 --> 00:15:28,823
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}What'd he mean by "other possibilities"?</font>

208
00:15:29,616 --> 00:15:31,910
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}This is real easy to follow.</font>

209
00:15:32,494 --> 00:15:36,748
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She did make these notes
especially for me, after all. Hm?</font>

210
00:15:37,791 --> 00:15:38,708
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">HANG IN THERE!</font>

211
00:15:41,711 --> 00:15:47,092
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sadako, your drawings suck so much!</font>

212
00:15:51,680 --> 00:15:54,975
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She worked so hard... to make this for me...</font>

213
00:15:55,767 --> 00:15:57,811
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Who else would do this?</font>

214
00:16:02,065 --> 00:16:06,736
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey, Chizu. Are you able to come
meet me at the bridge right now?</font>

215
00:16:08,154 --> 00:16:10,240
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Did your exam go well?</font>

216
00:16:10,323 --> 00:16:14,703
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh... yeah. But mostly the parts
that Sadako's notes explained.</font>

217
00:16:14,786 --> 00:16:15,620
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I see.</font>

218
00:16:16,746 --> 00:16:20,333
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ever since things got awkward between the
three of us, she hasn't even smiled once.</font>

219
00:16:20,417 --> 00:16:24,004
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Just before that happened, it kinda
seemed like she was the happiest she'd</font>

220
00:16:24,087 --> 00:16:27,298
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">ever been.</font>

221
00:16:27,382 --> 00:16:30,593
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I definitely saw a genuine smile when
we all studied for the exam together.</font>

222
00:16:30,677 --> 00:16:34,639
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah, that's right! I was
so surprised! We all were!</font>

223
00:16:40,478 --> 00:16:41,396
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That Sadako...</font>

224
00:16:41,980 --> 00:16:43,189
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hm?</font>

225
00:16:43,273 --> 00:16:47,027
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She was so used to being avoided by
everyone, that living that way seemed</font>

226
00:16:47,110 --> 00:16:50,864
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">completely normal to her. It actually
makes me depressed just thinking about it.</font>

227
00:16:50,947 --> 00:16:54,617
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Because she's such a sweet girl.</font>

228
00:16:54,701 --> 00:16:57,370
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's why I chose not to
ignore her like the others did.</font>

229
00:16:57,454 --> 00:17:00,290
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah... That might explain it.</font>

230
00:17:00,373 --> 00:17:03,918
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">People ostracized her long enough for
her to become fully desensitized to it.</font>

231
00:17:04,002 --> 00:17:07,547
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Eventually it spread to her own feelings.</font>

232
00:17:07,630 --> 00:17:11,760
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's weird but, I think I get why that
seemed like the only option. So when she</font>

233
00:17:11,843 --> 00:17:16,014
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">had such a genuine smile on her face
back then, it made me way happier than it</font>

234
00:17:16,097 --> 00:17:18,475
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">should have.</font>

235
00:17:18,558 --> 00:17:20,977
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wait, that was going through
your head at the time? Same for me.</font>

236
00:17:21,061 --> 00:17:24,064
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey... Come on, don't
cry-it's embarrassing.</font>

237
00:17:25,482 --> 00:17:30,236
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kinda funny we had the same thought but
we're only learning that after the fact.</font>

238
00:17:31,237 --> 00:17:34,783
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I can't believe we spent this whole time
thinking we knew Sadako pretty well, when</font>

239
00:17:34,866 --> 00:17:38,411
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">in reality we're totally frustrated
because it turns out that we knew nothing</font>

240
00:17:38,495 --> 00:17:42,040
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">about her at all. But to be fair, you
and I have a lot to learn about each other</font>

241
00:17:42,123 --> 00:17:45,585
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">too.</font>

242
00:17:46,711 --> 00:17:49,714
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yano, maybe we should talk about the
real reason we came out here in the first</font>

243
00:17:49,798 --> 00:17:52,842
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">place.</font>

244
00:17:52,926 --> 00:17:58,473
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sadako has no clue how we feel about
her right now or how anxious we are.</font>

245
00:17:59,641 --> 00:18:03,019
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What'd she mean when she said "I'm sorry"?</font>

246
00:18:03,103 --> 00:18:05,063
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And "they're not my friends..."</font>

247
00:18:06,272 --> 00:18:08,525
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Or anything in that talk we had.</font>

248
00:18:10,693 --> 00:18:15,740
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If we'd just asked directly, I
wonder... what would she have said to us?</font>

249
00:18:18,368 --> 00:18:22,872
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She's nowhere near the type of person
I'd normally involve myself with. So, it's</font>

250
00:18:22,956 --> 00:18:25,667
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">really kind of funny that all I've
been doing is thinking about her.</font>

251
00:18:25,750 --> 00:18:28,461
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's frickin' annoying! Like, come on!
How much more is she gonna have us keep</font>

252
00:18:28,545 --> 00:18:31,548
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">worrying?</font>

253
00:18:31,631 --> 00:18:34,634
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If anything, by having her on our minds
so often, it only proves just how attached</font>

254
00:18:34,717 --> 00:18:37,720
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">we've grown.</font>

255
00:18:39,430 --> 00:18:43,434
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I once said that I couldn't answer, if
they asked about our friendship with her.</font>

256
00:18:43,518 --> 00:18:47,522
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But I know now that's
definitely what it is.</font>

257
00:18:48,481 --> 00:18:53,820
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">After all, Sadako deserves it for
getting us to be this concerned about her.</font>

258
00:18:54,821 --> 00:18:59,868
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You won't ever know someone's true
feelings unless you ask about them. Even</font>

259
00:18:59,951 --> 00:19:04,956
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">your own feelings will remain
unknown unless you convey them properly.</font>

260
00:19:05,039 --> 00:19:07,834
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">"I'd like to get to know you better, if
that's okay." I want how I feel to be</font>

261
00:19:07,917 --> 00:19:11,087
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">known.</font>

262
00:19:11,171 --> 00:19:16,259
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And I don't have to worry if that's
alright for me to want. To have been able</font>

263
00:19:16,342 --> 00:19:21,472
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">to meet people who helped me get
to this point makes me... so happy.</font>

264
00:19:24,851 --> 00:19:29,939
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">When I run into Yano and Yoshida today,
I'll say, "C-Can we please talk for a</font>

265
00:19:30,023 --> 00:19:35,111
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">sec?" Wait, no... They probably study
during breaks, so maybe after school?</font>

266
00:19:35,195 --> 00:19:38,698
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ugh... but they'll be
studying for tomorrow too...</font>

267
00:19:38,781 --> 00:19:41,618
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">"I-I'm sorry to be a bother, but
can we p-please talk for a sec."</font>

268
00:19:41,701 --> 00:19:44,537
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey... I-Is there a voice
coming from that stall?</font>

269
00:19:44,621 --> 00:19:46,331
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Stop, you're scaring me!</font>

270
00:19:46,414 --> 00:19:48,875
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm nervous, but... it's fine.</font>

271
00:19:49,709 --> 00:19:52,170
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">At least you know you
can open up to them.</font>

272
00:19:52,253 --> 00:19:54,881
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I can tell them my feelings.</font>

273
00:19:54,964 --> 00:19:58,009
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If anyone will listen,
it's Yano and Yoshida.</font>

274
00:19:58,092 --> 00:20:01,179
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh man... I totally blew today's exams.</font>

275
00:20:01,262 --> 00:20:04,015
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Ugh. Yeah, tell me about it.
- No, no, no! I spent way too</font>

276
00:20:04,098 --> 00:20:06,434
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">long mentally preparing myself!</font>

277
00:20:06,517 --> 00:20:08,853
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I've been meaning to
mention... Remember that Sadako rumor?</font>

278
00:20:08,937 --> 00:20:12,815
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah. The one about Yano
and Yoshida as her backup?</font>

279
00:20:13,566 --> 00:20:14,484
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What?</font>

280
00:20:15,193 --> 00:20:19,614
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- It turns out...
- It's... a misunderstanding!</font>

281
00:20:25,995 --> 00:20:30,291
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Those two girls aren't my backup. Nor have
they ever been anything like that. Which</font>

282
00:20:30,375 --> 00:20:34,629
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">means... um... you're just
spreading around false information.</font>

283
00:20:34,712 --> 00:20:38,716
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yano and Yoshida are nice people
and I don't think they deserve this.</font>

284
00:20:38,800 --> 00:20:42,845
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Did you hear her? She said
that they're "nice people."</font>

285
00:20:42,929 --> 00:20:45,598
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Is this an excuse to talk to us?</font>

286
00:20:45,682 --> 00:20:48,393
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Ooh, she looks kinda mad.
- I, uh... This is how my face always</font>

287
00:20:48,476 --> 00:20:51,813
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">looks, but a-anyway... could we please-</font>

288
00:20:53,731 --> 00:20:56,901
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Shut the hell up. We get it. This
is about Yano and Yoshida, yeah?</font>

289
00:20:56,985 --> 00:21:00,697
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So, you understa-</font>

290
00:21:00,780 --> 00:21:04,534
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh. Understand that they're a
slut and a delinquent~ course I do.</font>

291
00:22:27,533 --> 00:22:29,577
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Mistakes to be fixed.</font>

292
00:22:29,660 --> 00:22:31,329
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Lingering feelings.</font>

293
00:22:32,372 --> 00:22:34,457
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Next time: "Friends"</font>
